  "description": "Lumeo is a modern, accessible Blazor component library with 103 production-ready components. Built on Tailwind CSS v4 with 8 color themes and dark mode. Features 30+ chart types via ECharts, enterprise DataGrid with inline editing and export, programmatic overlay service, form validation, full keyboard navigation, and 1,316 unit tests. Inspired by shadcn/ui and Radix.",
